+# ADR-0509: Source-seal the paired local evaluation loop
+
+- Status: accepted source-only seal upon its separately authorized decision commit
+- Date: 2026-09-07
+- Follows: ADR-0508
+- Base-Commit: 34616938c708b1ca306b9d8a17b9d98e2f9e451f
+- Invocation-Authority: none; no comparative evaluation or new demonstration
+- Front-Door-Kind: controller-v1
+- Front-Door-Research: ADR-0280
+- Front-Door-Process: ADR-0509
+- Front-Door-Contract: ADR-0307
+- Front-Door-Revoked: ADR-0281, ADR-0468, ADR-0472, ADR-0475
+- Front-Door-Active-Next: Preregister a bounded paired evaluation population and invocation
+- Front-Door-Blockers: evaluation population and invocation remain unadmitted
+
+## Decision
+
+Accept the exact reviewed paired local evaluation source as a CPU-only asset,
+closing the source increment opened by ADR-0508. The outer loop fixes matched
+baseline-rules-v1 and blueprint-v1 trials before execution, reuses the unchanged
+public session CLI, and reports paired chip differences only for the complete
+planned population. This source decision makes no playing-strength claim.
+
+Effect requires this exact decision's separately authorized commit. Draft metadata,
+review refs and passing correctness controls do not activate a source seal.
+Incorporate only the twelve bound source paths, this new ADR and generated STATUS.
+The six prospective registration exceptions close with these accepted versions;
+all files outside the permitted source surface remain unchanged.
+Source acceptance grants no actual comparative evaluation or demonstration.
+
+## Bound source and behavior
+
+Task: v0a-evaluation-source/r001.
+Commit: bca326c6bfedd71324a19c809f617e267cc9e0a2.
+Base: 34616938c708b1ca306b9d8a17b9d98e2f9e451f.
+Tree: 5eec124adf1de52da1e36c50848c5d55f8866b75.
+Manifest SHA-256:
+02f06a3ae8a7cefb5ba8f5a5abaf94f2a91a661a1d5f1ade3e1b3f8c4ae02860.
+
+The complete twelve-path population is the source contract under
+docs/architecture/v0a-evaluation-r001/: two new stdlib tools, three new finite
+correctness suites, one literal fixture and six exact registration exceptions.
+Every incorporated path must equal its reviewed raw Git blob. The complete sorted
+manifest and raw payload copies are retained at
+D:/Pontius-handoffs/v0a-evaluation-source/r001/ and at
+D:/Pontius/tmp/v0a-evaluation-source-r001/packets/r001/.
+The inherited semantic base B remains e043f81ecec3ac16128720b42c3312bb41a4ed67.
+All paths outside the twelve-path source increment equal the adopted opening base.
+
+Canonical request bytes fix deal/lineup/seat order, alternating strategy order,
+all six positions, identical saved input for both arms, and six fresh 200-chip
+stacks per trial. Original physical cards remain fixed across seat rotations.
+The parent uses only the accepted seeded recipe and native host Job through three
+fixed admitted raw-buffer aliases; the unchanged public session owns poker actions,
+source admission, legal fallback, timing, host application and settlement.
+
+The wrapper creates the complete plan before play, retains intent before process
+creation and captures failures without retrying or starting later units. Native
+suspended creation, Job assignment before resume, bounded parallel stream capture
+and descendant cleanup preserve explicit unknown outcomes. Source and saved-input
+checks share the whole-run clock, including full trial plus cleanup reserve at
+admission. The exact unchanged child CLI and scrubbed environment remain bound.
+
+Strict versioned observation distinguishes baseline selections from host-applied
+actions and legacy choices. Valid incomplete observations remain unverified prefixes;
+action failure observations and propagated hand/session causes retain separate scopes.
+Unknown values remain null, and incomplete trials cannot supply a score. Aggregate
+arithmetic uses the full planned denominator with no survivor-only result.
+
+Final publication creates an exclusive pending guard before either final file.
+Actual write, flush, fsync, close, readback, source/input revalidation and the final
+shared-clock check precede irreversible commit. Only then may the writer attempt
+one empty-guard removal. Release failure does not revoke committed bytes. Consumers
+require absent guard and stable, schema-valid, hash-bound result/completion files;
+exit status, marker existence and prepared timestamps alone establish nothing.
+This provides no visibility-by-deadline or universal OS-blocking hard-wall claim.
+
+## Review and verification
+
+Both fresh independent Tier C whole-source reviews bind the source commit and
+manifest above, with CLEAN, specification PASS, engineering PASS and design SOUND.
+No required source corrections remain. Each reviewer recorded an independent
+census/assertion inventory before reading authored census explanations.
+Reports under the permanent packet's reviews directory:
+
+- review-a.md, issuer Codex /root/evaluation_source_review_a, SHA-256
+  034bc3a780b0e83c34519707183dff5dc33fedab6289efa4a0407f554b4e09cc.
+- review-b.md, issuer Codex /root/evaluation_source_review_b, SHA-256
+  255af51e120b379e371083724f011c5edc314a577a1b4a3655ed7b34d4786346.
+
+After both CLEAN reviews, all 32 prescribed acceptance commands passed: all sixteen
+on actual CPython 3.11.15 first, followed by all sixteen on actual 3.14.6.
+There were 296 tests per interpreter, 592 total test executions,
+with zero failures, errors or skips in the final selected population. Each command
+and its actual-version/flags/cwd preflight used a fresh exact-candidate D-local
+snapshot, -B -P, snapshot cwd/src, scrubbed environment and absolute native Git.
+The unchanged status, boundaries and inventory gates, all three new suites and
+the named seeded-deal, host, session and provider regressions passed.
+
+The full receipt index is
+D:/Pontius/tmp/v0a-evaluation-source-r001/packets/r001/checks/final-acceptance-summary.json,
+SHA-256 de8544829b01d05d5f2ff2d3b3b5168bdff20b8de40355368aeb000af03e9bcb.
+It binds the exact candidate, harness, all 32 passing receipts and all retained
+prior command receipts. Correctness receipts make no hosted-CI or performance claim.
+
+The new finite population contains 71 tests: 24 contract, 28 runner and 19 boundary.
+The fixture contains one distinct literal full deal and synthetic request/report/wire
+examples. One all-zero-seed twelve-session matrix and two real single-session
+retention controls total fourteen poker starts per complete new-suite execution,
+within the authorized twenty-four. Contract and boundary suites start zero poker
+sessions. Non-poker native controls exercise real process/Job/descendant behavior;
+publication-only synthetic records exercise real files and guard release. Independent
+literal arithmetic and controlled negative mutants test matrix, scoring, action-cause,
+assignment and final-clock oracles. None is an evaluation population.
+
+Source audit SHA-256:
+d9b949942d44643d228a544d50c5dcf71b656967dca1cb47a54a198a06464167.
+The delta is 1,232/1,250 production lines, 1,656/1,800 new test lines,
+138/160 manual registration added/removed lines and 20,335/32,768 fixture bytes.
+Generated inventory/profile output is counted separately. Exact scope, raw blobs,
+LF/BOM/width/whitespace and preservation checks passed. The controller explicitly
+approved increasing the original 1,200-line production cap to 1,250 and routine
+small adjustments on 2026-09-07. The retained ruling SHA-256 is
+82c997a7b7702adc5d35389b27234107177caf49c3ebf6e794597b52ea32e0d9.
+This changes neither the correctness contract nor source/execution authority.
+
+All 3,041 old inventory records and 440 old payload records remain exact and ordered.
+The three new suites add 71 IDs; both installed capability hashes remain zero.
+Complete baseline/candidate test and production census captures were compared on
+both actual interpreters before literal refresh and again afterward. Every old row,
+ordered duplicate, assertion chain and grant survives exact source-line mapping.
+The full populations preserve 141 expanded rows and add 15 typed blockers,
+6 analyzed sites, 146 helper edges, one decoy and 72 universe/deny-all rows.
+No analyzer behavior, inference or capability grant changed. All 312 occurrence
+additions in each comparison have exact source/line/closure explanations.
+
+Final complete comparison records under the source task root:
+
+- census-post1-test/explained-comparison.json, SHA-256
+  1bf46c9f01fb4a62a2c94248858e1c28784e6fcb28030e4dd6af2c98a8c35cad.
+- census-post1-production/explained-comparison.json, SHA-256
+  81fe7ddaec4c7c1d6bf7b75d39ea7bb3747a7afc5a24ac1f534ed63098e7a317.
+
+These records bind all raw captures and complete populations. Their final census
+snapshot 6f59993ba2e5229e2d8ffdbb8de4187b576450b4 has an identical whole source tree
+to the reviewed candidate, with the distinct commit identity explicitly retained.
+
+## Retained development outcomes
+
+All original checkpoints, reports, RED/GREEN receipts, snapshots and partial roots
+remain retained. Two bounded substantive source FIX rounds were used. FIX01 moved
+cross-row conflict checks before prefix mutation. FIX02 validated captured native Git
+bytes before every Git launch and cleared scoring/completion flags after a later
+retention failure, while preserving the actual completed unit record and stopped
+prefix. Each correction has retained independent review and executable controls.
+Earlier NOT CLEAN outcomes remain unchanged; the final whole-source reviews cover
+the complete corrected candidate.
+
+Pre-review boundary iterations retained an insufficient non-deadline test-helper
+budget failure and an inventory refusal of inherited unittest classes. The finite
+helper allowance became 30,000 ms while exact deadline-edge controls kept their
+explicit clocks; boundary tests were flattened into direct TestCase classes without
+changing their bodies/oracles. The existing inventory analyzer remained unchanged.
+Earlier harness/setup refusals and deliberately failing controls remain distinct
+in the receipt index. No failed root was cleaned up, rerolled or relabeled successful.
+
+Permanent local coordination packets are preserved byte-exactly. During preparation,
+automatic approval review rejected the separate GitHub handoff upload, leaving its
+explicit authorization pending at metadata freeze. Local preservation is not a
+remote-upload claim; any later upload receives its own disposition. Retained evidence
+remains at its original D-local paths.
+
+## Metadata integration and next boundary
+
+Following the prior source-seal integration procedure, the metadata candidate
+requires one fresh independent Tier A light review, exact incorporation of all
+twelve source blobs and the unchanged status generator --check plus all twelve
+status tests on actual 3.11.15 first and then 3.14.6, in four fresh exact-candidate
+snapshots. The complete integration delta is exactly fourteen paths. These metadata
+checks replace no source review or source acceptance gate. The controller separately
+authorizes the exact decision commit; neither draft status nor local review refs
+claim adoption.
+
+The next step is a separately preregistered population: seed, distinct lineups,
+size, resource budgets, metrics, stopping/retention and interpretation must be fixed
+prospectively. An exact invocation then needs its own authority. No comparative
+evaluation, tuning, neural loading, training, self-play, league, new opponents,
+human play, operating/research claim, cleanup, export or ref retirement follows
+from this source seal. Earlier demonstration owners remain consumed and closed.
+The research/operating prerequisites and ADR-0307 runtime contract remain binding.
